{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32858","headline":"府试丹浦非乐战 · 李频","name":"府试丹浦非乐战","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自古爲君道，垂衣致理难。\n怀仁须去杀，用武即胜残。\n毒帜诛方及，兵临衅可观。\n居来彭蠡固，战罢洞庭宽。\n雪国知天远，霜林是血丹。\n吾皇则尧典，薄伐至桑亁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}